#tmp folder and tmp files
tmp/
_*.*
_*/
# Package initialisers are code, not temp files. `_*.*` above matches every
# `__init__.py`, so the negation has to come after it: git applies the last
# matching pattern. Scoped to `.py` so `__*` junk files stay ignored.
!__*.py
